<body>

<header class="site-header">
    <div class="container header-inner">

        <a href="/" class="logo">STREETKICKS</a>

        <nav class="main-nav">
            <a href="/">Home</a>
            <a href="/shop">Shop</a>
            <a href="/shop?category=new">New Arrivals</a>
            <a href="/shop?category=collections">Collections</a>
            <a href="/shop?category=deals">Deals</a>
        </nav>

        <div class="header-actions">
            <a href="/shop" aria-label="Search">⌕</a>
            <a href="/wishlist" aria-label="Wishlist">♡</a>
            <a href="/cart" aria-label="Shopping Cart">🛒</a>

            <button id="theme-toggle" type="button">☾</button>

            <button class="menu-toggle" type="button">☰</button>
        </div>

    </div>
</header>

<main>

    <section class="page-hero">
        <div class="container">
            <span class="hero-label">STREETKICKS</span>
            <h1>ABOUT US</h1>
            <p>Step into your style.</p>
        </div>
    </section>

    <section class="content-section">
        <div class="container">

            <div class="content-block">
                <h2>Who We Are</h2>

                <p>
                    STREETKICKS is a modern sneaker store created for people
                    who believe that footwear is more than just something
                    you wear. Your sneakers are part of your identity,
                    lifestyle and personal style.
                </p>

                <p>
                    We bring together stylish sneakers for men, women and
                    kids, giving customers an easy way to discover,
                    compare and shop for their next pair.
                </p>
            </div>

            <div class="content-block">
                <h2>Our Mission</h2>

                <p>
                    Our mission is to make sneaker shopping simple,
                    accessible and enjoyable while providing customers
                    with a collection of footwear that combines style,
                    comfort and value.
                </p>
            </div>

            <div class="content-block">
                <h2>Why STREETKICKS?</h2>

                <div class="info-grid">

                    <div class="info-card">
                        <h3>Quality</h3>
                        <p>
                            We focus on sneakers that offer style,
                            comfort and everyday usability.
                        </p>
                    </div>

                    <div class="info-card">
                        <h3>Style</h3>
                        <p>
                            Discover different designs for different
                            lifestyles and occasions.
                        </p>
                    </div>

                    <div class="info-card">
                        <h3>Convenience</h3>
                        <p>
                            Browse products and shop from wherever
                            you are.
                        </p>
                    </div>

                    <div class="info-card">
                        <h3>Customer First</h3>
                        <p>
                            We aim to make every part of your shopping
                            experience straightforward.
                        </p>
                    </div>

                </div>
            </div>

        </div>
